$ pace begin Call ACME   # at 10:00
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Ended [ID-1] "Write offer" at 10:00 after 1h.
Began [ID-2] "Call ACME" at 10:00.

----- stderr -----

$ pace adjust --start 09:30   # at 10:30
success: false
exit_code: 1
----- stdout -----

----- stderr -----
  × the entry would overlap [ID-1] (09:00–10:00)
  help: move it, or allow it with `pace adjust --allow-overlap`


$ pace adjust --start 09:30 --allow-overlap   # at 10:30
success: true
exit_code: 0
